              "type": "string",
              "value": "CONTEXT:\nUser question: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nApp context: {{$context.$app.$OraAppContext}}\nApp mode: {{$context.$variables.appContextMode}}\n\nTASK:\nThe user question is outside the supported areas for this shared Ask Oracle workflow.\nFor Marketing Strategy Advisor, supported areas are active programs, cross-sell accounts, and renewal account/product summaries.\nFor Renewals Advisor, supported areas are renewal accounts, buying groups, content and messaging strategy, and programs.\n\nOUTPUT:\nReturn one concise plain-text sentence. Say that you can't answer that here and briefly name the relevant supported areas for the current app. Do not mention workflow routing, BOs, or internal node names. Do not answer the out-of-scope question."
            }
