        {
          "id": "1782122421751",
          "code": "GENERATE_ACCOUNT_DISPLAY",
          "type": "LLM",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Account Display"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 9203,
            "y": 9700
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1782122421751_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Return only valid oraInfoDisplay and oraInsight blocks. Keep account rows compact and always include the messageListWidget title and description."
            },
            {
              "id": "1782122421751_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input:\n  {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_ACCOUNT_DISPLAY_PAGE.$output.result}}\n\nGenerate only the XML-like widget blocks. Do not add any prose before, between, or after the blocks.\n\nRequired first block:\n<oraInfoDisplay key=\"list\">\n{\n  \"title\": \"<input.title>\",\n  \"patternId\": \"messageListWidget\",\n  \"description\": \"<input.description>\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"subtitle\": \"<input.subtitle>\",\n    \"items\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"<row.title>\",\n        \"subtitle\": \"<row.subtitle>\",\n        \"badgeText\": \"<row.badgeText>\",\n        \"priority\": \"<row.priority>\",\n        \"summary\": \"<row.summary>\",\n        \"action\": \"<row.action>\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n</oraInfoDisplay>\n\nHard requirements for the oraInfoDisplay:\n- Always include top-level title, patternId, description, and properties.\n- patternId must be exactly \"messageListWidget\".\n- title must be exactly input.title.\n- description must be exactly input.description.\n- properties.subtitle must be exactly input.subtitle.\n- properties.items must contain every valid row from input.rows, in the same order.\n- If displayedCount is 0, output an empty items array and no oraInsight blocks.\n\nRow display rules:\n- Keep each account row compact.\n- Each item must include title, subtitle, badgeText, and priority.\n- Include summary only when row.summary is not empty. Do not expand or rewrite row.summary. Do not exceed the provided row.summary.\n- Include action only when row.action is not empty. Omit action when row.action is empty.\n- Do not add extra explanation, recommendations, long descriptions, markdown, or technical field names to individual account rows.\n\nPagination blocks:\nIf hasPrevious is true, append exactly one low-priority oraInsight:\n<oraInsight>\n{\n  \"title\": \"Previous Accounts\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"Review the previous page of accounts.\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Previous Accounts\",\n  \"priority\": false,\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"<previousFollowUpCommand>\"\n}\n</oraInsight>\n\nIf hasNext is true, append exactly one low-priority oraInsight:\n<oraInsight>\n{\n  \"title\": \"Next Accounts\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"Review the next page of accounts.\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Next Accounts\",\n  \"priority\": false,\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"<nextFollowUpCommand>\"\n}\n</oraInsight>\n\nReplacement rules:\n- Replace placeholders with values from the input object.\n- Use previousFollowUpCommand and nextFollowUpCommand exactly as provided.\n- Do not invent page values, row values, IDs, counts, titles, descriptions, or actions.\n- Do not output null. Omit optional fields instead."
            }
          ],
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "enableActions": true,
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MESSAGES_LIST"
              ]
            }
          }
